\mbox{area}&=\frac{1}{2}\cdot8\cdot\sqrt{20}\\
&=4\cdot\sqrt{20}\\
&=4\cdot2\sqrt{5}\\
&=\boxed{8\sqrt{5}}.
\end{align*}

